    <div style="background:#3e2723;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #ffb74d;margin-bottom:20px;">
    <h3 style="color:#fff3e0;margin-top:0;">🧠 Lesson Summary</h3>
    <p>Geography is the study of the Earth’s surface and the interaction between people and their environment. The physical environment is natural; the human environment is made by people. The branches are Physical Geography (landforms, climate, water, soils, life), Human Geography (population, settlement, economic, political) and Practical Geography (maps, statistics, fieldwork, GIS).</p>
    <h4 style="color:#fff3e0;margin:16px 0 6px 0;">🗒️ Revision notes</h4>
    <ul style="margin:6px 0;padding-left:22px;">
    <li>Meaning of Geography.</li>
    <li>Physical and human environments.</li>
    <li>Three branches and sub-branches.</li>
    <li>Classifying topics.</li>
    </ul>
    </div>
